BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
40. 438.7900000000000773 Td
(In modern apparel manufacturing, quality non-conformances \(fabric holes, missing stitches, shade variation, oil stains,) Tj
T* (measurement skews\) represent substantial financial write-offs and customer delivery penalties when caught late in the packing or) Tj
T* (shipping stages. Traditional paper-based quality registers and ad-hoc chat channels fail due to lack of traceability, delayed) Tj
T* (supervisor containment actions, missing visual evidence, and zero executive accountability.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
40. 382.7900000000000773 Td
(The Garment Manufacturing Quality Management System \(QMS\) delivers an automated, closed-loop defect rectification platform.) Tj
T* (It bridges roving quality inspectors directly with production line supervisors under strict SLA countdowns \(12 hours for Critical) Tj
T* (defects, 24 hours for Major defects\). By demanding photographic evidence before and after rectification, and computing instant) Tj
T* (plant-wide compliance ratings, the system achieves 100% defect traceability from floor discovery through final auditor sign-off.) Tj
ET
