40. 452.5150000000000432 Td
(Garment QMS replaces paper registers with an immediate digital workflow. Floor auditors photograph defects via mobile devices;) Tj
T* (the system compresses images locally, extracts GPS/line metadata, assigns the complaint to the designated supervisor, and) Tj
T* (arms a real-time countdown timer. Once the supervisor completes root-cause analysis and uploads after-rectification photos, the) Tj
T* (ticket shifts to "Under Review". The auditor must physically verify the fix to either approve & close or reject for rework.) Tj
